# Sample corpus (SPEC 8.3a). The raw reports and photographs are somebody's real
# vehicles, photographed in somebody's garage, so they stay on the machine that made
# them. What ships is redacted word geometry plus its fixtures - see
# homeautoshop/scantools/capture.py. Note the directory itself is NOT ignored:
# a negation cannot re-include anything inside an excluded directory.
# Parts orders are shipping documents: a name, a street address, a phone number and an
# email, twice over. Captured as redacted text and geometry by
# homeautoshop/purchasing/importers/capture.py, and the capture is what ships.
Artifacts/samples/**/*.pdf
Artifacts/samples/*.jpg
Artifacts/samples/**/*.jpeg
Artifacts/samples/**/*.png
